[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 22440.39, "timestamp": "06:14:00", "text": "自己的专属艺人，你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22442.708, "timestamp": "06:14:02", "text": "知道，你可以签一份互惠合同之类的，比如"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22445.548, "timestamp": "06:14:05", "text": "成为她的独家"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22448.788, "timestamp": "06:14:08", "text": "艺人之类的。因此，这就导致其他"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22451.51, "timestamp": "06:14:11", "text": "艺人不能为她做"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22456.07, "timestamp": "06:14:16", "text": "项目，也不能"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22458.15, "timestamp": "06:14:18", "text": "和其他YouTube博主合作，而这些博主恰好"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22461.19, "timestamp": "06:14:21", "text": "是她最亲密的朋友等等。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22466.47, "timestamp": "06:14:26", "text": "某种程度上来说，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22469.19, "timestamp": "06:14:29", "text": "现在情况很糟糕。那位艺人在一份谷歌文档上公开了这件事，事情就是从那时"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22475.75, "timestamp": "06:14:35", "text": "开始发酵的。最后，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22479.43, "timestamp": "06:14:39", "text": "她虽然道歉了，但却把责任推给了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22481.948, "timestamp": "06:14:41", "text": "她的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22485.11, "timestamp": "06:14:45", "text": "经纪人，因为是经纪人到处宣扬这件事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22490.548, "timestamp": "06:14:50", "text": "但某种程度上她也"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22493.91, "timestamp": "06:14:53", "text": "知道这件事，她也跟"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22497.43, "timestamp": "06:14:57", "text": "那些艺术家说过类似的话，比如“是啊，别再搞艺术了”，然后"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22499.59, "timestamp": "06:14:59", "text": "其他YouTube博主的项目就直接"}]